# Pin the registry used to build this repo.
#
# This machine's user-level ~/.npmrc points npm at the Tencent Yun mirror
# (mirrors.tencentyun.com). That host is unreachable from CI, and because a
# lockfile records the resolved tarball URL of every dependency, running
# `npm install` here silently wrote six http://mirrors.tencentyun.com URLs
# into package-lock.json. The build then failed with ENOTFOUND before it
# compiled a single file.
#
# Declaring the registry in the repo means npm resolves to registry.npmjs.org
# no matter whose machine or CI container is doing the install. Keep the
# lockfile's resolved URLs on this host from now on.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
